severity = "blocker"
closed = "EndBlock now sweeps every allowed non-network fee denom from each transaction coinbase to the block's coinbase, failing the block on a rejected sweep, and RouteCollectedFeeTokens then holds or distributes it; the FeeTokenSweep and SidioraFeeCollection tests pass at exit 0 on ecebaa2f51cecadf1de6ca104b4609548e1c72a9."

